## Tech stack

| Layer           | Choice                                                                  |
| -----------------| -------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| App             | Expo SDK + Expo Router                                                  |
| Language        | TypeScript (strict)                                                     |
| Styling         | NativeWind v4 + brand tokens in `tailwind.config.js` / `src/lib/tokens` |
| Forms           | Zod + react-hook-form                                                   |
| Auth storage    | `expo-secure-store` (not sessionStorage)                                |
| State           | React context first; no Redux unless needed later                       |
| Icons           | `lucide-react-native`                                                   |
| Package manager | **pnpm only**                                                           |
| Realtime        | `@microsoft/signalr` + `/hubs/notifications`                            |

---

## Key conventions

- Alias `@/` → `src/` (FE modules re-copied under `src/lib/...`).
- Do **not** copy FE `components/ui` (shadcn/DOM) — rebuild with `View` / `Text` / `Pressable`.
- API/validation/errors: **copy + adapt** from FE; see **`AGENTS.md`** when contracts change.
- Gate on supported roles after `getCurrentUser`.
- Vietnamese copy aligned with FE Parent strings where possible.
- Student/parent PII: never log tokens or personal data.
- Keep design tokens; no new hex / web multi-column dashboards.

